  "description": "XXL-JOB Admin（Spring Boot）监控：依赖 **Micrometer Prometheus** 暴露 `/actuator/prometheus`。官方仓库默认仅有 `spring-boot-starter-actuator`，需在 `xxl-job-admin` 增加 `io.micrometer:micrometer-registry-prometheus`，并配置 `management.endpoints.web.exposure.include=health,prometheus`（按需）。默认 `server.servlet.context-path=/xxl-job-admin`，抓取地址示例：`http://<host>:8080/xxl-job-admin/actuator/prometheus`。指标为 JVM/进程/HTTP/Hikari 等通用 Spring 指标；XXL 业务任务量需自研埋点。",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "id": 100,
      "options": {
        "content": "**前置**：在 Admin 工程加入 `micrometer-registry-prometheus`，并放开 `prometheus` 端点；Prometheus `scrape_configs` 指向 `.../xxl-job-admin/actuator/prometheus`（端口、context-path 以实际为准）。\n\n**本看板**：基于 Spring Boot 3 + Micrometer 常见指标名（`jvm_*`、`process_*`、`http_server_requests_*`、`hikaricp_*` 等）。若某 Panel 无数据，多为未暴露对应指标或未启用 Tomcat MBean（`server.tomcat.mbeanregistry.enabled=true`）。",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "说明（XXL-JOB Admin）",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "mappings": [
            { "options": { "0": { "color": "red", "index": 0, "text": "抓取失败" } }, "type": "value" },
            { "options": { "1": { "color": "green", "index": 1, "text": "抓取正常" } }, "type": "value" }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": 0 },
              { "color": "green", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 4 },
      "id": 1,
